      *> One row per vehicle, keyed by licence plate and linked to its owner.
       FD  VEHICLE-FILE
           RECORD CONTAINS 109 CHARACTERS.
           01 VEHICLE-RECORD.
               05 VEH-PLATE PIC X(8). *> Primary key
               05 VEH-CUS-ID PIC 9(8). *> Owner, CUS-ID
               05 VEH-CHASSIS PIC X(17).
               05 VEH-BRAND PIC X(20).
               05 VEH-MODEL PIC X(30).
               05 VEH-YEAR PIC 9(4).
               05 VEH-COLOR PIC X(15).
               05 VEH-MILEAGE PIC 9(7). *> Kilometres
